WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.433
Approximation, but without any bounds.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.303
Blocks of points at least one apart,

3
00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:07.605
ever farther away. Each defeats small operators.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.636
Each block's anchors defeat small operators; wedged together, no bound survives.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.329
Claimed: approximation works, but never with a bound.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.327
Main theorem Lean-checked.
